    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You seize your companion&#39;s hand. The strength you give them leaves your own breath thin, but theirs comes back.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Reaction</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>One adjacent willing or unconscious creature after it enters Dying and its wound is resolved.</dd></div><div><dt>Equipment / acquisition</dt><dd>A free hand.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Recovery</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Pay 7 HP and restore 12 HP to the recipient.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30/design/cards/not-yet-your-name.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/not-yet-your-name.md</a> at <code>25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30</code>.</p></section>",
